125	// Validates a remote "extends" URL and all its children.
126	// For each URL in the chain: fetches the content (SSRF-guarded), runs validateSpectralRuleset
127	// to block disallowed keys such as custom "functions" (the RCE vector), then recurses into
128	// any nested extends entries. Content is never merged — the original URL is preserved in
129	// "extends" for Spectral to fetch at lint time using spectralRuntime.fetch.
130	// Note: We do not flatten the content of remote extends URL entries because users would need to re-upload their ruleset anytime a change is made to a ruleset they extend.
